     "<div dir=\"ltr\">FYI<br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">---------- Forwarded message ----------<br>From: <b class=\"gmail_sendername\">Sebastian Schreiber</b> <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">sschr...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;</span><br>Date: Mon, Apr 24, 2017 at 4:09 PM<br>Subject: Fwd: Introductory GIS Workshop in R on May 4th<br>To: Theory Theory group &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">t...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;, <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">gge-st...@ucdavis.edu</a>, <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">axe-g...@ucdavis.edu</a>, <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">animalb...@ucdavis.edu</a><br><br><br><div dir=\"ltr\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">---------- Forwarded message ----------<br>From: <b class=\"gmail_sendername\">Kelsey Lyberger</b> <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">klyb...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;</span><br>Date: Mon, Apr 24, 2017 at 3:59 PM<br>Subject: Introductory GIS Workshop in R on May 4th<br>To: <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">c...@ucdavis.edu</a><br><br><br><div dir=\"ltr\">Dear all,<br><br>\r\nYou are invited to attend an Introductory GIS Workshop in R by Kelsey \r\nLyberger. Please see below and the attached flyer. <div> <br>\r\n<br><b><font size=\"4\">\r\nIntroductory GIS Workshop in R<br></font></b>\r\n<br>\r\nCome learn about working with spatial data in R!<br>\r\n<br>\r\nThursday, May 4 • 12–4pm • Data Science Initiative (&quot;DSI&quot;,Shields Library room 360)<br>\r\n<br>\r\nNew to R? Please come with R (<a href=\"https://www.r-project.org/\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.r-project.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466927764000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1tuE5dzb25eo1g0qiPi9H9\">https://www.r-project.org/</a>) and R Studio (<a href=\"https://www.rstudio.com/products/rstudio/download/\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.rstudio.com/products/rstudio/download/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466927764000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0e4TyQyufeLVEpPJ2cfCkM\">https://www.rstudio.com/products/rstudio/download/</a>)\r\n installed on your computer.  If you need help getting started go to the\r\n D-RUG (Davis R User&#39;s Group), which meets at the DSI from 10am-12pm on \r\nTuesdays.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nWorkshop topics will include:<br>\r\n•    Why do I need to know the map projection, coordinate system, and datum of my spatial data?<br>\r\n•    How to design an informative and visually pleasing map<br>•    How to add your own geographic data to a basemap<div><br>RSVP to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">klyb...@ucdavis.edu</a><span><font color=\"#888888\"><br></font></span></div></div></div><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n</font></span></div><span><font color=\"#888888\"><br><br clear=\"all\"><div><br></div>-- <br><div data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\">------------------------------------------------<br>Department of Evolution and Ecology<br>One Shields Avenue<br>University of California<br>Davis, CA 95616<br><br>Web page: <a href=\"http://www.eve.ucdavis.edu/sschreiber/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.eve.ucdavis.edu/sschreiber/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466927764000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1DuWkOQm0XbZxuW0mgLcfI\">http://www.eve.ucdavis.edu/sschreiber/</a></div>\r\n</font></span></div>\r\n</div><br><br clear=\"all\"><div><br></div>-- <br><div class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;